# Phase 5 (BILLING-ROADMAP.md, sporecount-agri-app repo) — this site has no
# backend of its own. The /supplies order form (src/components/
# SuppliesOrderWidget.tsx) calls back into the sporecount-agri-app backend,
# which is the one place Stripe credentials live.
#
# Set this to that backend's public base URL, with NO trailing slash, e.g.
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://sporecount-agri-app.onrender.com
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined into the client bundle at build time, so
# this must be set in the Vercel project settings for sporecount-site
# (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) BEFORE the next deploy — it
# cannot be set from inside this repo or from this codebase at build time
# alone. It is not a secret (it's just a URL this site already calls over
# plain HTTPS), but it does need to be correct for every environment
# (Production/Preview/Development) that should be able to place an order.
#
# Also make sure the sporecount-agri-app backend's ALLOWED_ORIGINS env var
# includes this site's domain(s) (e.g. https://sporecount.com), or its CORS
# policy will reject the request from the browser.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=

# "Pay now by card" on /supplies is hidden unless this is "true" at build time. It is off for now: the card
# page has no tax or shipping line and prices vary by client, so orders are invoiced instead. The backend
# must also have SUPPLIES_CARD_CHECKOUT_ENABLED=true for card payment to work; turn both on together.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPPLIES_CARD_CHECKOUT=true
